# 2026-07-13 16:21:53.112014
+Act as the lead architect and implementation engineer of the Lucifer Memory System.
+
+Current status:
+
+✅ RAW conversation storage works
+✅ Summary generation works using qwen3:8b
+✅ Summary markdown generation works
+✅ Dedicated memory model (qwen3:8b) is configured
+✅ Main chat functionality must remain unchanged
+
+Goal:
+
+Implement Memory Phase 3: Decision Generation.
+
+Do NOT implement Insights yet.
+Do NOT implement Tasks yet.
+
+==================================================
+MEMORY PHILOSOPHY
+==================================================
+
+Lucifer Memory is NOT:
+
+- a RAG system
+- a Vector Database
+- a Search Engine
+
+Lucifer Memory exists to preserve:
+
+- Project history
+- User decisions
+- User preferences
+- Project evolution
+
+The goal is long-term memory, not information retrieval.
+
+==================================================
+SUMMARY IMPROVEMENT
+==================================================
+
+The current summary quality is too literal.
+
+The summary should NOT be a conversation summary.
+
+The summary should be a PROJECT MEMORY RECORD.
+
+Ignore:
+
+- placeholder text
+- testing messages
+- debugging messages
+- temporary examples
+- AI self-references
+- implementation artifacts
+
+Focus only on:
+
+- actual project goals
+- implementation progress
+- completed work
+- accepted decisions
+- next planned actions
+
+Do NOT describe who said what.
+
+Do NOT describe the conversation itself.
+
+Do NOT mention that the user asked a question.
+
+Do NOT mention example text.
+
+Do NOT mention placeholder content.
+
+Write only persistent project memory.
+
+Output format:
+
